%%{init: {'sequence': {'noteMargin': 20}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Server as Game Service
    participant Hydra

    Client->>Server: Any command (e.g. lobby.list)
    Note over Server: Re-validate session
    alt Session near expiry
        par Acknowledge immediately
            Server-->>Client: Acknowledge
        and Renew in background
            Server->>Hydra: Refresh token grant
            Hydra-->>Server: New access + refresh token
            Note over Server: Session renewed
        end
    else Session expired, not renewed
        Server-->>Client: disconnect Socket + Acknowledge(UNAUTHENTICATED)
    end
